    "max_features": 64,
    "max_classes": 10
  },
  "compute": {
    "cpu": "f32"
  },
  "_note": "Random-init Nori fixture (Apache-2.0 architecture, our weights), regression only, in the released checkpoint's own torch.save layout {model_config, ema_state_dict}. H is DYNAMIC; y carries RAW train targets only (length = train_size). The model standardises features itself and the wrapper standardises the target in-graph, so the engine profile is *_raw. The output is ONE raw-space point estimate per row (the mean of the quantile head); rows < S are in-context fitted values (context rows presented a second time as queries)."
}
